"\n\n\n\n\n## Ordered\n\n\n## Review\nThe burger place we originally planned to go to had no seats, so we ended up wandering nearby and stumbled upon this spot.\n\nOrdered Old School and Boss as Combo 2.  \nI couldn't tell a huge difference between the two, but Boss was clearly more my style.\n\nCombo 2 came with fries, and the portion was surprisingly massive.  \nWe finished every last piece, of course.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n"